README.md:368:> Tracking modifiers accept pairs directly. Pass `ChildOf(parent)` (or `ChildOf('*')` for any target) to track a specific relation pair. The base relation form tracks trait-level changes, while the pair form tracks per-target changes.
README.md:377:const anyChangedChildren = world.query(Changed(ChildOf('*')))
